0..66 Comment "//! `tactics-over-goals` models tactic splices in value positions."
67..70 Comment "//!"
71..140 Comment "//! `assumption` returns the innermost binder whose type is the goal."
141..219 Comment "//! `intro` builds a function from a tactic answer under an introduced binder."
220..349 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses a missing answer, a wrong goal, an untyped splice, an unknown tactic, and a computation splice."
350..353 Comment "//!"
354..445 Comment "//! The checker runs each tactic, checks its answer against the goal, and fills the splice."
446..492 Comment "//! The kernel replays the filled declaration."
493..496 Comment "//!"
497..513 Comment "//! - see: #2762"
